      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Full-day group trip to Machu Picchu with an English-speaking guide. Lunch is included. Return to Cusco by train and transfer to the hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:92aee667be07b8e4",
